u00f3prio ERP, permitindo que novas solu\u00e7\u00f5es de neg\u00f3cio se ajustem ao perfil espec\u00edfico das empresas.<\/p><p>Esta personaliza\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 feita \u00e0 medida das exig\u00eancias de cada setor de neg\u00f3cio, garantindo que as solu\u00e7\u00f5es oferecidas s\u00e3o adequadas \u00e0s necessidades particulares de cada organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p><p>Com esta flexibilidade, \u00e9 poss\u00edvel criar e associar novas funcionalidades a um software de gest\u00e3o que j\u00e1 \u00e9, por si s\u00f3, bastante completo e organizado.<\/p><p>Al\u00e9m disso, o ERP Cegid<span class=\"s1\">\u00a0permite faturar respeitando todos os requisitos legais e fiscais, gerir o invent\u00e1rio integrado com a contabilidade, bem como processos contabil\u00edsticos, financeiros e fiscais.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c5d6565 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c5d6565\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f093070 elementor-widget elementor-widget-video\" data-id=\"f093070\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;youtube_url&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/youtu.be\\\/wF4TuOFi040?si=SPwMDFE0ycfzudC3&quot;,&quot;show_image_overlay&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;image_overlay&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/devlop.systems\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/cegid-5.jpg&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:12999,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;library&quot;},&quot;video_type&quot;:&quot;youtube&quot;,&quot;controls&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"video.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widg